    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Become the wizard you were born to be \u2014 or perish trying.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Enter the arcane battlefield where spellcasters clash in intense, high-stakes duels. <i>The Wizards Arena\u00a0</i>is a fast-paced <strong>dueling game\u00a0</strong>where you control a wizard, wielding powerful spells and clever tactics to survive against  magical enemies in  arena battles.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\ud83c\udfae <strong>Singleplayer Campaign: Rise of a Champion</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Start as a level 1 wizard with limited spells and raw potential.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Battle increasingly powerful foes in arena duels.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Earn gold, experience, and glory with each victory \u2014 or learn from your defeats.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Return to your base between matches to rest, train, unlock new spells, and prepare for the next day\u2019s challenge.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Every duel pushes you closer to greatness \u2014 or sends you back to the drawing board.</strong></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\u2694\ufe0f <strong>Multiplayer Mode: Pure Dueling Action</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Compete in fast-paced, skill-based matches: <strong>1v1, 2v2, or 3v3</strong>.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >No grinding, no levels \u2014 just raw magical skill with your friends.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Cast, dodge, and counter in adrenaline-fueled arena battles.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\ud83c\udf1f <strong>Key Feature: Using Mouse Like a Wand</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83e\uddd9 <strong>In The Wizards Arena, you use your mouse movement as direct input that controls the wand wielding hand, creating an intuitive way of doing magic, instead of just pushing down a key on your keyboard.\u00a0</strong></p></li></ul>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Become the wizard you were born to be \u2014 or perish trying.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Enter the arcane battlefield where spellcasters clash in intense, high-stakes duels. <i>The Wizards Arena\u00a0</i>is a fast-paced <strong>dueling game\u00a0</strong>where you control a wizard, wielding powerful spells and clever tactics to survive against  magical enemies in  arena battles.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\ud83c\udfae <strong>Singleplayer Campaign: Rise of a Champion</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Start as a level 1 wizard with limited spells and raw potential.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Battle increasingly powerful foes in arena duels.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Earn gold, experience, and glory with each victory \u2014 or learn from your defeats.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Return to your base between matches to rest, train, unlock new spells, and prepare for the next day\u2019s challenge.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Every duel pushes you closer to greatness \u2014 or sends you back to the drawing board.</strong></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\u2694\ufe0f <strong>Multiplayer Mode: Pure Dueling Action</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Compete in fast-paced, skill-based matches: <strong>1v1, 2v2, or 3v3</strong>.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >No grinding, no levels \u2014 just raw magical skill with your friends.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Cast, dodge, and counter in adrenaline-fueled arena battles.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\ud83c\udf1f <strong>Key Feature: Using Mouse Like a Wand</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83e\uddd9 <strong>In The Wizards Arena, you use your mouse movement as direct input that controls the wand wielding hand, creating an intuitive way of doing magic, instead of just pushing down a key on your keyboard.\u00a0</strong></p></li></ul>",
    "short_description": "Fight in an arena build for wizards to duel against each other. Use your mouse like a wand and do some qool magic. You are basicly a gladiator but instead of swords, you use wands and spells.",
